  <h1>They Called It the Perfect Drug. One FDA Reviewer Said No.</h1>
  <p class="dek">A brand-new FDA reviewer read a 'perfect' sleeping pill with no lethal dose. She said no, four times. That no kept America out of the disaster that crippled 8,000 babies worldwide.</p>
</article>

